# S45-id: e1m1's first-room grunt woken, at 240 Hz, played at 1/8. id's drawing: the grunt
# moves in 0.1 s steps and changes pose on them. The player stands in the doorway, inside
# the closed door's brush, so the grunt never has a clear shot and keeps running. The
# camera is the player's eye, framed tighter (fov 64). Film second 0 is the wake; 30 film
# frames a second at speed 1/8 is one 240 Hz host frame each. The window, frames 66 to
# 392, is game seconds 0.275 to 1.6375 after the wake.
#
# Under V3-28: "Monsters still think ten times a second. At two hundred and forty hertz,
# id's grunt stands still for twenty-three frames, then jumps."
#
# Assembly (S45): the 940x1040 crops at (350,20) of S45-id and of S45-slop, side by side
# at (13,20) and (967,20) of a black 1920x1080 frame, each film frame shown twice (1/8
# speed at 60 fps), labelled "id's" and "slop".

map e1m1
wake 0,576,24 at 0

duration 13.1
fps 30
size 1920x1080
frames 66..393

preset slop
speed 0.125
hud off
player 224,616,24,190
cvar gamma 0.8
cvar r_lerpmove 0
cvar r_lerpmodels 0

camera fixed 224,616,46 2,200
fov 64

sound off
events on
